## Documentation Index
The Devin MCP server provides programmatic access to Devin’s platform capabilities for both private and public repositories.

## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#devin-mcp-server)  Devin MCP Server
### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#authentication-required)  Authentication Required
#### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#enterprise-accounts-x-org-id-header)  Enterprise accounts: `X-Org-Id` header
```
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "devin": {
      "serverUrl": "https://mcp.devin.ai/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <API_KEY>",
        "X-Org-Id": "<YOUR_ORG_ID>"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#key-differences-from-deepwiki-mcp)  Key Differences from DeepWiki MCP
| Feature | DeepWiki MCP | Devin MCP |
|-|-|-|
| **Authentication** | None required | API key required |

## [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#setup-instructions)  Setup Instructions
### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#for-devin-desktop)  For Devin Desktop:
```
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "devin": {
      "serverUrl": "https://mcp.devin.ai/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <API_KEY>"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### [​](https://docs.devin.ai/work-with-devin/devin-mcp#for-most-other-clients-e-g-cursor-)  For most other clients (e.g. Cursor):
```
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "devin": {
      "url": "https://mcp.devin.ai/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <API_KEY>"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

